 "note": "A ranking of the cells within 8 km of the fire for the next one to two days, not a probability and not a timing. Wind is not used. Archived fires from 2025, scored as they would have been at the time. Places and roads from OpenStreetMap (fetched when the run was made; the January 2021 extract where the service was busy); population from WorldPop 2019-2020."
}